    "body": "# SUPERSEDED ROUTE — HISTORICAL FRAME-PRODUCTION EVIDENCE\n\nSTATUS = SUPERSEDED BY OWNER CORRECTION 2026-09-12\nCURRENT MASTER PRODUCT ROUTER = #274\nCURRENT PIPELINE = `studio/ZORR_30S_BATTLE_PIPELINE_R01.md`\n\nThe previous `10s-first` duration target in this issue is no longer the current product route.\n\n## CURRENT OWNER DIRECTION\n\nThe current product is a repeatable approximately 30-second vertical anime battle short for social audience growth.\n\nCurrent loop:\n\n`SCENARIO -> STORYBOARD/LAYOUT -> KEY POSES + BREAKDOWNS -> RIFE INBETWEENS -> DAVINCI RESOLVE/FUSION -> SOUND/QC -> RELEASE -> LEARN -> NEXT SHORT`\n\nA 30-second short may be split internally into 3 x ~10-second blocks for organization only. Those blocks are not independent gates and production must not stop after the first 10 seconds unless a real blocker exists.\n\n## WHAT REMAINS VALID FROM THIS ISSUE\n\nThe useful controlled-frame architecture remains reusable:\n- key poses/extremes are not enough by themselves;\n- semantic breakdowns control path, arc, overlap, contact and spacing;\n- 24fps master does not require 24 unique drawings per second;\n- deliberate holds/exposures are valid;\n- classify adjacent states as SMALL / MEDIUM / LARGE visual change;\n- SMALL change may be a RIFE candidate;\n- MEDIUM change requires semantic breakdown(s) before interpolation;\n- LARGE change / occlusion / newly revealed form / major rotation / contact / impact / cut must not be blindly interpolated;\n- never interpolate across a cut;\n- bad interpolation is repaired locally while accepted keys remain frozen;\n- DaVinci Resolve/Fusion remains the assembly/composite/edit/sound environment;\n- deterministic frame/timing/QC evidence remains useful.\n\n## WHAT IS SUPERSEDED\n\nDo NOT use the following as current authority:\n- `WE START FROM 10 SECONDS`;\n- `10s-first` as a product gate;\n- requirement to complete a 10s master before continuing the same approved 30s short;\n- stopping after Module A / first 240 frames simply because the old route said 10s-first.\n\n## CURRENT AUTHORITY\n\nRead:\n1. current `main`;\n2. `ZORR_EXECUTION_CONSTITUTION.md`;\n3. `AGENTS.md`;\n4. issue #274;\n5. `studio/ZORR_30S_BATTLE_PIPELINE_R01.md`.\n\nThis issue remains only as historical evidence for the key/breakdown/inbetween method and prior production experiments.\n",
